  "rationale": "No evidence-supported optimization cleanly applies to this workflow without risking build coverage or safety. P-LIT-GHA-CACHE requires a lockfile for cache keying, which the workflow lacks; caching system apt packages or compiled agbcc binaries raises mutable/untrusted cached content concerns. P-LIT-FAIL-FAST requires a matrix strategy, which is absent. P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT lacks sufficient representative timing history to set a safe limit and risks cutting off valid slow runs. P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE is contraindicated because the workflow performs deployment-like work (pushing to the symbols branch on push).",
